+## 5. Current Behavior
+
+The `Shell` component in `session/index.tsx` renders the bash/shell tool output
+inside a `BlockTool` wrapper. `BlockTool` supports a collapsed preview mode and
+an expanded body mode, toggled by clicking when `collapsible()` is true.
+
+### Collapsed (preview) path
+
+```
+shellPreviewText() -> [header, "", output()].join("\n")
+                     = "$ command\n\noutput"
+```
+
+The `""` element inserts an empty line between the command header and the
+output. This string is passed to `previewText()` for truncation, then rendered
+as a single `<text>` element inside the preview area of `BlockTool`.
+
+**Result**: `$ command` → *(empty line)* → `output` — spacing is present.
+
+### Expanded (body) path — no context output
+
+```tsx
+<box>
+  <text fg={theme.text}>$ {props.input.command}</text>
+  <Show when={output()}>
+    <text fg={theme.text}>{output()}</text>
+  </Show>
+</box>
+```
+
+The `<box>` has no `gap` prop and no spacer element between the command
+`<text>` and the output `<text>`. The two `<text>` elements render as
+consecutive lines.
+
+**Result**: `$ command` → `output` — **no spacing** (BUG).
+
+### Expanded (body) path — with context output (right-click "returned to model")
+
+```tsx
+<box>
+  <text fg={theme.text}>$ {props.input.command}</text>
+  <Show when={showContextOutput()}>
+    <text fg={theme.info}>Model context output</text>
+  </Show>
+  <Show when={output()}>
+    <text fg={theme.text}>{output()}</text>
+  </Show>
+</box>
+```
+
+When `showContextOutput()` is true, the "Model context output" `<text>` element
+renders between the command and output, acting as the separator line.
+
+**Result**: `$ command` → `Model context output` → `output` — spacing is
+present as text, but the user finds this awkward: the text line is neither a
+clean empty line nor a meaningful label, and it is redundant with the title
+suffix `· returned to model`.
+
+### Summary of the divergence
+
+| View | Separator between command and output | Correct? |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Collapsed (preview) | Empty line (`""` in joined string) | yes |
+| Expanded, no context | **None** (consecutive `<text>` elements) | **no — BUG** |
+| Expanded, with context | "Model context output" text (awkward, redundant with title) | **no — user requests removal** |
