+## 10. Single Approved Primary-Path Design
+
+Repair the first divergence by (1) removing the "Model context output" text
+line from the `Shell` expanded body, and (2) wrapping the output `<text>` in a
+`<box marginTop={1}>` to provide an unconditional empty-line separator between
+command and output.
+
+```
+$ command
+  ↓
+[empty line via marginTop={1} — always, regardless of context mode]
+  ↓
+output
+```
+
+### Design details
+
+In the `Shell` body JSX (lines 2715–2723), make two changes:
+
+1. **Remove** the `<Show when={showContextOutput()}><text>Model context output</text></Show>` block.
+2. **Wrap** the output `<text>` in `<box marginTop={1}>` to provide consistent
+   empty-line spacing.
+
+Before:
+```tsx
+<box>
+    <text fg={theme.text}>$ {props.input.command}</text>
+    <Show when={showContextOutput()}>
+        <text fg={theme.info}>Model context output</text>
+    </Show>
+    <Show when={output()}>
+        <text fg={theme.text}>{output()}</text>
+    </Show>
+</box>
+```
+
+After:
+```tsx
+<box>
+    <text fg={theme.text}>$ {props.input.command}</text>
+    {/* "Model context output" 文字行已移除：标题标签 · returned to model 和
+        背景色已足够区分上下文模式，命令与输出之间统一用空行分隔，与折叠预览保持一致。 */}
+    <Show when={output()}>
+        <box marginTop={1}>
+            <text fg={theme.text}>{output()}</text>
+        </box>
+    </Show>
+</box>
+```
+
+### Why this repairs the first divergence
+
+The first divergence is that the expanded body lacks a separator that the
+collapsed preview has. R2 repairs this by adding an unconditional `marginTop={1}`
+on the output wrapper, which produces the same empty-line effect as the `""` in
+`shellPreviewText`. Removing the "Model context output" text eliminates the
+awkward half-separator and makes all three rendering modes use the same
+empty-line convention.
+
+### Context-mode distinction after R2
+
+When `showContextOutput()` is true, the user still sees a clearly different
+view through three signals that remain unchanged:
+
+1. **Title suffix**: `# Shell · returned to model` (via `contextLabel` prop)
+2. **Background color**: `theme.diffContextBg` (via `contextView` prop)
+3. **Border color**: `theme.info` (via `contextView` prop)
+4. **Output content**: `props.output` (full model output) instead of `props.metadata.output` (compressed)
+
+No body-internal label is needed.
+
+### Spacing convention
+
+The codebase convention (per BlockTool comment at line 2584–2588 and existing
+test at line 106–109) uses `marginTop` on `<box>` wrappers for vertical
+spacing, not `gap` on containers. The fix follows this convention.
